1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:01:00,320
= kisskh.lv =

2
00:00:00,367 --> 00:00:03,527
(Scenes with child actors were filmed safely with guardians and staff present.)

3
00:00:07,508 --> 00:00:10,310
Ji Won Ho, you can alter the fitting now, right?

4
00:00:10,511 --> 00:00:11,978
Alter the fitting here?

5
00:00:12,045 --> 00:00:13,179
What are you talking about?

6
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:15,825
The finale will go on as planned.

7
00:00:15,849 --> 00:00:17,450
How? When we don't even have a model?

8
00:00:18,686 --> 00:00:19,752
I will do it.

9
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:21,120
What?

10
00:00:24,758 --> 00:00:26,859
Ji Won Ho, I'll give you ten minutes.

11
00:00:47,948 --> 00:00:49,449
Hurry. We don't have time.

12
00:00:50,384 --> 00:00:51,985
Right. Okay.

13
00:01:13,106 --> 00:01:14,506
And now, the highlight of the day.

14
00:01:14,675 --> 00:01:16,643
Our finale model is making her entrance.

15
00:02:04,123 --> 00:02:05,391
Bravo!

16
00:02:25,512 --> 00:02:26,645
Just stunning.

17
00:02:27,015 --> 00:02:28,015
Perfect.

18
00:02:55,509 --> 00:02:57,510
(Episode 4)

19
00:02:58,111 --> 00:02:59,155
You were beautiful.

20
00:02:59,179 --> 00:03:01,624
- I enjoyed the show so much.
- Thank you for coming.

21
00:03:01,648 --> 00:03:02,971
- Truly the best.
- You're so beautiful.

22
00:03:02,995 --> 00:03:05,284
- The dress was stunning.
- Right? Thank you.

23
00:03:06,753 --> 00:03:07,964
Have some champagne too.

24
00:03:07,988 --> 00:03:09,932
Sure. You did a wonderful job today.

25
00:03:09,956 --> 00:03:12,157
- Have a great time.
- Sure.

26
00:03:18,531 --> 00:03:20,676
He says it was an absolutely spectacular finale.

27
00:03:20,700 --> 00:03:21,700
Thank you.

28
00:03:21,802 --> 00:03:24,642
Please tell him that it was an honor for me to work with Bruni as well.

29
00:03:30,310 --> 00:03:31,577
Thank you.

30
00:03:32,846 --> 00:03:35,614
Ms. Baek, someone is waiting for you outside.

31
00:03:36,550 --> 00:03:38,095
Can you take a picture with us?

32
00:03:38,119 --> 00:03:39,996
You were so cool.

33
00:03:40,020 --> 00:03:41,364
Can you take a picture with us, please?

34
00:03:41,388 --> 00:03:42,432
Mr. Ji.

35
00:03:42,456 --> 00:03:44,123
- All right.
- Can you make a heart?

36
00:03:45,058 --> 00:03:46,535
Great job today.

37
00:03:46,559 --> 00:03:48,704
- Please call us again next time.
- Thank you.

38
00:03:48,728 --> 00:03:49,805
Thank you.

39
00:03:49,829 --> 00:03:50,940
- Thank you.
- I was fascinated.

40
00:03:50,964 --> 00:03:51,741
Oh, thank you.

41
00:03:51,765 --> 00:03:53,632
- It was wonderful.
- See you next time.

42
00:04:11,418 --> 00:04:13,586
You were incredible on stage today.

43
00:04:14,321 --> 00:04:15,361
Congratulations, Mi Young.

44
00:04:20,761 --> 00:04:23,129
I always wondered what you would look like

45
00:04:24,164 --> 00:04:25,699
in a wedding dress.

46
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:28,367
You looked exactly as I imagined.

47
00:04:29,971 --> 00:04:30,971
Really?

48
00:04:32,506 --> 00:04:34,474
The dress I wore at my wedding was

49
00:04:35,208 --> 00:04:36,808
even more beautiful.

50
00:04:40,414 --> 00:04:42,014
Come to think of it, I should thank you.

51
00:04:42,983 --> 00:04:44,617
Thank you for leaving me back then.

52
00:04:46,020 --> 00:04:48,421
I didn't know the truth back then.

53
00:04:50,290 --> 00:04:51,857
If I had known beforehand,

54
00:04:54,060 --> 00:04:55,694
I would never have let you go like that.

55
00:04:58,298 --> 00:05:00,132
I'm sorry, Mi Young.

56
00:05:03,403 --> 00:05:04,403
Hey, Calvin.

57
00:05:21,388 --> 00:05:23,148
Don't try to pull something like this on me.

58
00:05:24,324 --> 00:05:27,860
I'm not the Baek Mi Young you used to know.

59
00:05:37,204 --> 00:05:39,204
At this rate, I will be taking pictures all night.

60
00:05:39,505 --> 00:05:40,683
My cheeks are starting to twitch.

61
00:05:40,707 --> 00:05:42,474
Have you seen designer Ji Won Ho?

62
00:05:42,609 --> 00:05:43,642
I'm looking for him too.

63
00:05:43,777 --> 00:05:45,188
I need to take a picture with him and post it on Instagram.

64
00:05:45,212 --> 00:05:47,112
- Where is he?
- Exactly.

65
00:05:48,515 --> 00:05:50,649
Hey, isn't that designer Ji Won Ho over there?

66
00:05:51,084 --> 00:05:52,985
- Where?
- Over there!

67
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:54,764
I think that's him. Let's go check.

68
00:05:54,788 --> 00:05:56,199
Yes, let's go.

69
00:05:56,223 --> 00:05:57,590
I think it's him.

70
00:05:58,358 --> 00:05:59,235
Mr. Ji!

71
00:05:59,259 --> 00:06:00,726
This way.

72
00:06:05,899 --> 00:06:08,210
That's strange. He was definitely here.

73
00:06:08,234 --> 00:06:09,779
He's not here.

74
00:06:09,803 --> 00:06:11,270
Did he go that way?

75
00:06:11,471 --> 00:06:13,272
- Let's go.
- Let's go that way.

76
00:06:23,750 --> 00:06:25,617
I can finally breathe.

77
00:06:26,353 --> 00:06:28,721
I know. It was so stuffy inside.

78
00:06:33,093 --> 00:06:34,093
This feels nice.

79
00:06:38,231 --> 00:06:40,151
You didn't come out here because of me, did you?

80
00:06:44,738 --> 00:06:45,871
See you, then.

81
00:06:47,141 --> 00:06:48,141
Chicken and beer!

82
00:06:50,443 --> 00:06:51,443
Buy me some.

83
00:06:52,612 --> 00:06:54,179
Buy me some chicken and beer.

84
00:06:55,048 --> 00:06:56,168
You can do that much, right?

85
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:09,328
Excuse me. One more 500cc beer, please.

86
00:07:09,563 --> 00:07:11,530
How much more are you planning to drink?

87
00:07:11,932 --> 00:07:13,833
Why? Are you scared?

88
00:07:14,301 --> 00:07:15,301
What?

89
00:07:15,434 --> 00:07:16,469
Don't worry.

90
00:07:16,668 --> 00:07:18,508
No matter how much I drink, I never get drunk.

91
00:07:23,143 --> 00:07:24,143
By the way,

92
00:07:24,779 --> 00:07:25,911
what is the reason?

93
00:07:26,479 --> 00:07:27,479
The reason?

94
00:07:27,614 --> 00:07:31,050
You know. You said it.

95
00:07:33,019 --> 00:07:34,019
Something about me.

96
00:07:36,489 --> 00:07:38,323
Oh, you mean why I like you?

97
00:07:42,662 --> 00:07:44,262
I've always remembered

98
00:07:46,633 --> 00:07:47,634
your warmth.

99
00:07:48,635 --> 00:07:49,635
My warmth?

100
00:07:51,004 --> 00:07:52,038
What you said to me

101
00:07:53,006 --> 00:07:54,006
eight years ago.

102
00:08:02,148 --> 00:08:05,548
Now that things have come to this, there's no reason for you to stay here any longer.

103
00:08:06,987 --> 00:08:07,987
So,

104
00:08:08,555 --> 00:08:10,290
you want me to go back to Korea by myself?

105
00:08:10,624 --> 00:08:11,624
If you stay,

106
00:08:12,025 --> 00:08:13,985
you will only keep fighting with your stepmother.

107
00:08:15,029 --> 00:08:17,329
If you had the talent, I could keep supporting you.

108
00:08:18,998 --> 00:08:20,499
I knew it would be uncomfortable,

109
00:08:21,335 --> 00:08:23,495
but I still tried to make it work for the three of us.

110
00:08:27,841 --> 00:08:30,342
So I mean nothing to you now, Dad?

111
00:08:31,912 --> 00:08:33,232
Just because I don't have talent?

112
00:08:34,381 --> 00:08:35,581
Don't feel too wronged.

113
00:08:36,017 --> 00:08:37,777
I've done everything I could as your father.

114
00:08:43,056 --> 00:08:45,124
My stepmother was from Milan,

115
00:08:46,660 --> 00:08:48,127
and she absolutely hated me.

116
00:08:51,164 --> 00:08:54,199
My father was always caught between us,

117
00:08:55,302 --> 00:08:56,969
and in the end, he chose her.

118
00:08:58,204 --> 00:08:59,204
He abandoned me.

119
00:09:28,001 --> 00:09:29,602
Where do you think you're going?

120
00:09:41,982 --> 00:09:44,417
Excuse me. You are Korean, right?

121
00:09:47,954 --> 00:09:49,555
It's good to help other people,

122
00:09:52,526 --> 00:09:54,806
but you shouldn't lose your own valuables in the process.

123
00:09:55,796 --> 00:09:57,863
This looks much more valuable than my wallet.

124
00:10:05,839 --> 00:10:06,839
You know.

125
00:10:08,242 --> 00:10:09,341
It will all pass.

126
00:10:12,546 --> 00:10:15,981
Stay strong. Someday, all of this will pass.

127
00:10:18,551 --> 00:10:19,551
But

128
00:10:21,021 --> 00:10:23,108
what you said to me back then...

129
00:10:24,057 --> 00:10:25,525
That everything would pass.

130
00:10:26,860 --> 00:10:28,227
It was such a simple thing to say,

131
00:10:28,695 --> 00:10:29,895
but it felt so comforting.

132
00:10:31,398 --> 00:10:33,833
Those words gave me the courage to start over.

133
00:10:34,835 --> 00:10:36,769
The courage to make it on my own.

134
00:10:39,439 --> 00:10:41,206
You must have been through a lot.

135
00:10:42,575 --> 00:10:43,575
I'm totally fine now.

136
00:10:44,477 --> 00:10:47,212
Just like you said, it really did all pass.

137
00:10:48,515 --> 00:10:50,683
I didn't really think much of it when I said that.

138
00:10:51,484 --> 00:10:53,152
Then was what you said at the end

139
00:10:53,819 --> 00:10:55,419
something you didn't really mean either?

140
00:10:56,222 --> 00:10:58,390
- What did I say?
- You said

141
00:10:58,958 --> 00:11:00,825
you were grateful that I found your wallet.

142
00:11:01,127 --> 00:11:02,694
You said that if we ever met again,

143
00:11:02,997 --> 00:11:04,597
you would make sure to return the favor.

144
00:11:05,265 --> 00:11:06,999
Oh, yes. That's right.

145
00:11:07,134 --> 00:11:09,601
I meant that. Of course I should return the favor.

146
00:11:11,337 --> 00:11:12,457
Meet up with me three times.

147
00:11:12,706 --> 00:11:13,516
What?

148
00:11:13,540 --> 00:11:15,774
From now on, whenever I want, just three times.

149
00:11:16,442 --> 00:11:18,043
Meet me like this and talk with me.

150
00:11:18,779 --> 00:11:20,346
That's how you can return the favor.

151
00:11:22,415 --> 00:11:23,415
Really?

152
00:11:24,218 --> 00:11:25,384
Is that all you want?

153
00:11:26,986 --> 00:11:27,986
Yes.

154
00:11:29,489 --> 00:11:30,489
Okay.

155
00:11:32,259 --> 00:11:33,259
Cheers.

156
00:11:36,930 --> 00:11:38,631
But doesn't this feel like fate?

157
00:11:39,532 --> 00:11:42,534
Ever since that day, I prayed every time there was a full moon.

158
00:11:43,069 --> 00:11:45,109
I prayed that I would get to see you again someday.

159
00:11:46,673 --> 00:11:47,806
And then,

160
00:11:48,508 --> 00:11:50,108
we actually met again!

161
00:11:50,877 --> 00:11:51,877
Oh, please.

162
00:11:53,046 --> 00:11:54,126
What are you talking about?

163
00:11:54,213 --> 00:11:56,849
Excuse me. One more beer, please.

164
00:11:58,384 --> 00:12:00,752
You can order another one after you finish that.

165
00:12:06,659 --> 00:12:08,326
I'm dying here.

166
00:12:09,863 --> 00:12:11,130
Wait,

167
00:12:12,132 --> 00:12:13,933
how much have we had?

168
00:12:15,902 --> 00:12:17,936
Ten 500cc beers each.

169
00:12:20,173 --> 00:12:22,141
So, about 10 liters altogether?

170
00:12:22,442 --> 00:12:23,442
Gosh.

171
00:12:24,645 --> 00:12:27,379
But are you okay? You're not drunk?

172
00:12:28,181 --> 00:12:29,982
I'm completely fine.

173
00:12:30,984 --> 00:12:33,304
I told you, no matter how much I drink, I don't get drunk.

174
00:12:34,020 --> 00:12:36,065
You can really hold your liquor.

175
00:12:36,089 --> 00:12:38,199
You're the first person I've ever met

176
00:12:38,223 --> 00:12:40,192
who can drink better than my wife.

177
00:12:42,095 --> 00:12:45,097
Your wife must be a good drinker too.

178
00:12:45,564 --> 00:12:48,233
She can really drink. She's such a tough woman.

179
00:12:49,036 --> 00:12:52,137
That was one of the things that made me fall for her.

180
00:12:55,074 --> 00:12:56,207
Do you still

181
00:12:57,577 --> 00:12:58,677
love her?

182
00:13:01,748 --> 00:13:03,182
Does your heart still race

183
00:13:03,917 --> 00:13:05,784
when you see your wife?

184
00:13:18,865 --> 00:13:21,433
Why would my heart race?

185
00:13:22,635 --> 00:13:25,670
Let's go now. I can't drink any more.

186
00:13:53,700 --> 00:13:55,902
Why do you keep following me?

187
00:13:56,236 --> 00:13:58,504
- Because I'm worried about you.
- What?

188
00:13:58,804 --> 00:14:00,482
Do you know

189
00:14:00,506 --> 00:14:02,641
you almost fell three times on the way here?

190
00:14:03,509 --> 00:14:04,943
Oh, right.

191
00:14:05,745 --> 00:14:08,413
Do you live here?

192
00:14:09,393 --> 00:14:10,478
(Jihwaja Motel)

193
00:14:10,502 --> 00:14:11,653
Oh.

194
00:14:12,318 --> 00:14:14,553
This is my home for the time being.

195
00:14:16,489 --> 00:14:19,524
Anyway, I had fun today. Get home safely.

196
00:14:32,338 --> 00:14:33,338
Mr. Ji!

197
00:15:00,233 --> 00:15:01,300
Mr. Ji!

198
00:15:02,803 --> 00:15:03,902
Mr. Ji!

199
00:15:04,404 --> 00:15:06,505
Our phones got mixed up.

200
00:15:29,128 --> 00:15:30,428
Mi Young.

201
00:15:45,411 --> 00:15:47,011
Hurry. We don't have time.

202
00:15:47,147 --> 00:15:49,080
Right. Okay.

203
00:16:22,815 --> 00:16:24,693
(Mother-in-law's son)

204
00:16:24,717 --> 00:16:27,786
Won Ho, you worked really hard today.

205
00:16:35,061 --> 00:16:36,628
Thank you for today.

206
00:16:39,999 --> 00:16:40,999
Where are you

207
00:16:41,801 --> 00:16:42,801
now?

208
00:16:46,139 --> 00:16:48,807
(Mother-in-law's son)

209
00:16:54,080 --> 00:16:56,848
(Mi Young)

210
00:17:03,156 --> 00:17:05,034
The person you called is not available.

211
00:17:05,058 --> 00:17:06,925
Please leave a message.

212
00:17:30,116 --> 00:17:31,416
I knew it.

213
00:17:31,919 --> 00:17:33,185
What did he even take?

214
00:17:40,927 --> 00:17:41,960
Mi Young.

215
00:17:42,562 --> 00:17:44,095
What's going on at this hour?

216
00:17:44,832 --> 00:17:47,266
Hello. Have you been well?

217
00:17:47,400 --> 00:17:49,611
Oh, I'm always doing fine.

218
00:17:49,635 --> 00:17:51,269
Have you been well too?

219
00:17:51,971 --> 00:17:55,840
Yes. I am calling because...

220
00:17:56,342 --> 00:17:58,009
Is Won Ho

221
00:17:58,578 --> 00:18:00,211
at his mother's house by any chance?

222
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:03,882
Actually, Won Ho is staying at the motel right now.

223
00:18:05,084 --> 00:18:06,217
The motel?

224
00:18:06,519 --> 00:18:08,731
You know what our mother is like.

225
00:18:08,755 --> 00:18:10,635
He says he can't bring himself to stay at home,

226
00:18:10,690 --> 00:18:12,224
and that he's more comfortable here.

227
00:18:12,826 --> 00:18:14,993
- I see.
- Mi Young.

228
00:18:15,728 --> 00:18:19,541
Since we are talking about him, could you please come and take Won Ho with you?

229
00:18:19,565 --> 00:18:21,700
He's a complete mess these days.

230
00:18:24,871 --> 00:18:27,272
I'm sorry. You're going through all this because of us.

231
00:18:27,874 --> 00:18:30,575
No, you have nothing to apologize for.

232
00:18:32,044 --> 00:18:34,212
Mi Young, I'm sorry, but guests just came in.

233
00:18:35,181 --> 00:18:37,781
- You're staying overnight, right?
- No. We just need a few hours.

234
00:18:37,918 --> 00:18:38,918
Oh, right.

235
00:18:59,071 --> 00:19:00,138
When he sleeps

236
00:19:01,274 --> 00:19:02,874
he looks surprisingly like a little boy.

237
00:19:36,075 --> 00:19:39,678
(Jihwaja Motel)

238
00:19:53,192 --> 00:19:55,793
What kind of dream was that?

239
00:20:08,140 --> 00:20:09,907
What?

240
00:20:11,143 --> 00:20:12,310
Are you awake?

241
00:20:13,646 --> 00:20:16,314
What's going on? Why are you here?

242
00:20:16,482 --> 00:20:17,315
Excuse me?

243
00:20:17,383 --> 00:20:20,051
I mean, why were you sleeping here?

244
00:20:22,522 --> 00:20:25,977
Yesterday, I realized our phones got mixed up somehow.

245
00:20:26,001 --> 00:20:28,293
So I came back to swap them, and...

246
00:20:28,594 --> 00:20:29,594
And?

247
00:20:29,629 --> 00:20:32,164
I just passed out. I must've been exhausted.

248
00:20:32,732 --> 00:20:34,221
No matter how tired you were,

249
00:20:34,245 --> 00:20:36,645
what made you think you could sleep here? Are you out of your mind?

250
00:20:36,669 --> 00:20:38,770
What was I supposed to do? I already fell asleep.

251
00:20:39,038 --> 00:20:40,271
Can I turn back time?

252
00:20:49,249 --> 00:20:51,016
Won Ho is going to be so touched.

253
00:20:52,184 --> 00:20:53,795
Is that why you came all the way here this early?

254
00:20:53,819 --> 00:20:55,286
To bring him a change of clothes?

255
00:20:55,588 --> 00:20:56,755
I noticed

256
00:20:57,390 --> 00:20:59,458
he didn't pack a single thing.

257
00:21:00,059 --> 00:21:01,827
Who knows when he'll ever come home?

258
00:21:02,260 --> 00:21:04,162
Why don't you two just

259
00:21:04,864 --> 00:21:06,398
make up while you're at it?

260
00:21:07,433 --> 00:21:08,433
What?

261
00:21:08,501 --> 00:21:11,836
You don't really want a divorce either, do you?

262
00:21:12,304 --> 00:21:14,840
If you truly hated him, you wouldn't have brought him clothes.

263
00:21:16,442 --> 00:21:17,442
Hold on a second.

264
00:21:21,681 --> 00:21:23,548
It's Room 303, so head on up.

265
00:21:23,916 --> 00:21:25,861
No, you give them to him.

266
00:21:25,885 --> 00:21:26,885
No way.

267
00:21:27,253 --> 00:21:30,155
You brought them, so take them up yourself.

268
00:21:30,890 --> 00:21:31,956
Hurry up.

269
00:21:33,726 --> 00:21:34,726
Go on.

270
00:21:37,229 --> 00:21:38,229
Come on.

271
00:21:45,538 --> 00:21:47,472
Hee Ju, wait.

272
00:21:47,740 --> 00:21:48,616
What is it?

273
00:21:48,640 --> 00:21:50,542
Are you really just going to leave like this?

274
00:21:50,810 --> 00:21:52,244
How else am I supposed to leave?

275
00:21:52,411 --> 00:21:54,846
I mean...

276
00:21:56,615 --> 00:21:58,115
Wait a second.

277
00:21:59,585 --> 00:22:01,653
Last night, by any chance,

278
00:22:02,188 --> 00:22:04,956
I didn't do anything stupid, did I?

279
00:22:06,992 --> 00:22:08,626
I'm just

280
00:22:09,662 --> 00:22:11,229
asking just in case.

281
00:22:12,064 --> 00:22:15,600
Did you completely forget everything that happened yesterday?

282
00:22:16,269 --> 00:22:17,269
What?

283
00:22:22,241 --> 00:22:24,075
We made a deal yesterday, remember?

284
00:22:24,910 --> 00:22:25,977
A deal?

285
00:22:26,211 --> 00:22:28,013
You promised to go on three dates with me.

286
00:22:28,647 --> 00:22:31,183
Right, I remember that.

287
00:22:32,084 --> 00:22:33,084
That's all that matters.

288
00:22:33,953 --> 00:22:35,854
Hee Ju, wait!

289
00:22:42,795 --> 00:22:44,239
I'm sorry.

290
00:22:44,263 --> 00:22:46,664
I must have the wrong room.

291
00:22:47,834 --> 00:22:50,201
Hee Ju, wait, talk to me for a second.

292
00:23:07,319 --> 00:23:09,186
Mi Young. Are you leaving already?

293
00:23:12,258 --> 00:23:13,935
Won Ho.

294
00:23:13,959 --> 00:23:14,959
Mi Young, wait.

295
00:23:15,294 --> 00:23:17,428
Please listen to me, Mi Young.

296
00:23:19,032 --> 00:23:20,409
This is a huge misunderstanding.

297
00:23:20,433 --> 00:23:22,967
It's really not what it looks like.

298
00:23:23,269 --> 00:23:24,570
What do you think it looks like?

299
00:23:24,770 --> 00:23:26,330
What exactly do you think I'm thinking?

300
00:23:26,706 --> 00:23:28,206
I mean...

301
00:23:28,841 --> 00:23:31,409
Hee Ju, tell her.

302
00:23:33,913 --> 00:23:36,715
Nothing happened between us yesterday, right?

303
00:23:37,082 --> 00:23:38,006
That's right.

304
00:23:38,087 --> 00:23:41,085
Nothing happened between Mr. Ji and me.

305
00:23:42,788 --> 00:23:45,490
We were just having drinks, and we were so exhausted

306
00:23:46,058 --> 00:23:48,059
that we ended up sleeping together.

307
00:23:48,494 --> 00:23:49,527
That's right.

308
00:23:52,398 --> 00:23:53,909
Wait, what do you mean,

309
00:23:53,933 --> 00:23:55,077
